–24 hours.</li><li>Bring to room temperature, open gently while preserving the rim, then add tomato and mozzarella.</li><li>Bake at the oven&#39;s highest temperature until risen and charred; finish with basil and olive oil.</li></ol></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-nutrition"><header><h2>Estimated nutrition per serving</h2></header><dl><div><dt>Energy</dt><dd>About 2,850 kJ (680 kcal) per pizza</dd></div><div><dt>Fat</dt><dd>About 19 g</dd></div><div><dt>Carbohydrate</dt><dd>About 98 g</dd></div><div><dt>Protein</dt><dd>About 28 g</dd></div></dl><figure class="lux-recipe-video"><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/journal/recipe-pizza-margherita.webp'); ?>" aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza"><source src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/pizza-margherita.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Fresh basil lands on a Margherita pizza, bringing an Italian classic to life.</figcaption></figure><div class="lux-recipe-extra-videos"><video style="flex-grow: 0.527473; aspect-ratio: 0.527473" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/truffle-oil-pizza-portrait.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 0.527473; aspect-ratio: 0.527473" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/truffle-oil-bottles-portrait.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 0.527473; aspect-ratio: 0.527473" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza 3"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/truffle-oil-pour-portrait.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 0.566038; aspect-ratio: 0.566038" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza 4"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/new-arrivals/editorial-mosaic/mosaic-pizza-video-01.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 1.777778; aspect-ratio: 1.777778" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="Classic Margherita pizza 5"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/4109923.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-details"><div><dt>Reference region</dt><dd>Campania / Naples</dd></div><div><dt>Allergen note</dt><dd>Contains gluten and milk</dd></div><div><dt>Substitutions</dt><dd>Adjust water to the flour&#39;s absorption; low-moisture mozzarella can replace fresh mozzarella</dd></div><div><dt>Related products</dt><dd><a class="lux-recipe-product-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/product', '?category=pizza#product-catalogue')); ?>">Pizza catalogue (subject to live stock and label)</a></dd></div></section></article></main><?php endif; ?>
